  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Murong Qing Si lands at a pond of affinity wood and finds Cloud Gentleman Yun Liang already collecting it. She waits without obstructing him, then proposes a spar; he agrees that if she wins she may take the wood, and she asks only for half. He gives her half and both leave satisfied.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yun_liang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a Murong tribe immortal opposite Yun Liang over affinity wood. Longevity Heaven approves their marriage, which she takes as hard-earned love without knowing the larger schemes behind it.",
      "chapters": [
        1444
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marriage-approval",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_murong_tribe",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the day Yun Liang is to propose, her life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu shatter. She flies in panic along his route, finds a ruined battlefield, and cannot find him. Other Murong tribe Gu Immortals follow and see her state.",
      "chapters": [
        1445
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yun-liangs-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_soul_lantern_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan concludes Heavenly Court wrecked Longevity Heaven’s plan: Yun Liang was a lone immortal, Longevity Heaven had agreed to the marriage and even showed joy as preparation for the coming great era, and Heavenly Court would not allow that arrangement to stand.",
      "chapters": [
        1446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-wrecking",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    }
  ],
